Package: sgev
Type: Package
Title: Second-Generation E-Values for Sequential Regression
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Siyi", "Chen", email = "sche11@lsuhsc.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8019-8149"))
Description: Cohortwise nuisance elimination, normal-mixture e-values,
    practical-null decisions, and information comparisons for sequential
    Gaussian regression with known variance. Includes scalar profiles,
    box optimization, and a feasible-dual interface for convex hypotheses.
    Scores and information matrices are supplied by the user. Companion
    simulation scripts cover monitoring schedules, nuisance drift, paired
    practical decisions, cohort size, and stopping-time comparisons.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats
NeedsCompilation: no
